<Legal title={'Accessibility statement'} eyebrow='Accessibility' meta='Last updated: October 9, 2026' lede='Albena is meant for everyone in the household. We aim for this website to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.' description='Albena targets WCAG 2.2 AA conformance. Measures taken, known limitations and how to send accessibility feedback.'>
<section id="conformance"><h2>Conformance status</h2><p>Our <strong>target</strong> is WCAG 2.2 level AA. We have reviewed every page of albena.ai against these criteria, but we have not yet had an independent audit, so we describe this as a target and not a certified result.</p></section>
<section id="measures"><h2>Measures we have taken</h2><ul><li>One main heading per page, a logical heading order and landmark regions (header, navigation, main, footer).</li><li>A &ldquo;Skip to content&rdquo; link on every page and full keyboard operation with a visible focus indicator.</li><li>Text and interface colors checked for at least 4.5:1 contrast against their backgrounds.</li><li>Labelled form fields and status messages announced to screen readers.</li><li>Decorative graphics hidden from assistive technology, and meaningful illustrations given text alternatives.</li><li>Interactive targets at least 24 by 24 CSS pixels, and layouts that reflow down to a 320 pixel width without horizontal scrolling.</li><li>Animation is switched off when your system requests reduced motion, and no content depends on hover.</li></ul></section>
<section id="limits"><h2>Known limitations</h2><ul><li>The product illustration on the home page is a visual mock-up. Its content is summarized in a text description, but it is not interactive.</li><li>Albena&rsquo;s voice-first experience is not yet available to preview here, so we have not yet assessed it with people who use assistive technology. Voice control is designed to complement, not replace, touch and keyboard options.</li><li>The waitlist and support forms include a Cloudflare Turnstile verification check. It is designed to be accessible, but we have not tested every assistive-technology combination. If it blocks you, email us directly and we will help.</li></ul></section>
<section id="feedback"><h2>Feedback and contact</h2><p>If you hit a barrier on this website or want content in another format, email <a href="mailto:omar@dbaomarhuertasllc.com">omar@dbaomarhuertasllc.com</a> with the page and what went wrong. We aim to reply within 2 business days and to fix confirmed issues promptly.</p></section>
<section id="assessment"><h2>Assessment approach</h2><p>We tested with keyboard-only navigation, browser zoom and a 375 pixel wide viewport, automated checks and manual contrast review. This statement was prepared on October 9, 2026 and will be updated as the site and product change.</p></section>
<p class="legal-note">Related: <a href="/security">Security &amp; trust</a>, <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/support">Support</a>.</p>
</Legal>
